{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hook</i> into an intergalactic adventure with Scark'Tee, a fearless Naal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>3D platformer game based on hook physics</strong> offers a wild experience of speed and skill for players seeking a challenge, while providing <strong>free-roaming mechanics</strong> to discover the secrets of Naltiune as you improve the environment around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Latch onto an intergalactic adventure with Scark'Tee, a fearless Naals, and uncover the secrets of Naltiune, an inhospitable moon on the planet Aqueora, inhabited solely by the agile Naals. <strong>With his long tail, Scark'Tee swings, fights, and slide</strong> through dangerous environments, helping his friends and facing unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover how the Naals lived alongside Tee years before meeting Kadiha and her crew to embark on the grand journey of his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn to use your tail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move yourself freely</strong> hanging around with your tail like a real naals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/08402a26b10c602df2e9d951301a8ada.poster.avif?t=1755887781\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/08402a26b10c602df2e9d951301a8ada.webm?t=1755887781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/08402a26b10c602df2e9d951301a8ada.mp4?t=1755887781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>