_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/7678bfe10cff47254ce91dcaf3c665bd.webm?t=1755887781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/7678bfe10cff47254ce91dcaf3c665bd.mp4?t=1755887781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hang on animals</strong> that you need to complete your challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/0a2627d5b81d24c9e2b262fbba45ba6b.poster.avif?t=1755887781\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/0a2627d5b81d24c9e2b262fbba45ba6b.webm?t=1755887781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/0a2627d5b81d24c9e2b262fbba45ba6b.mp4?t=1755887781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick objects and avoid obstacles</strong> by tubes and opened trunks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/92fb3d4b885bcc34ececbc4a40557f83.poster.avif?t=1755887781\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/92fb3d4b885bcc34ececbc4a40557f83.webm?t=1755887781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/extras/92fb3d4b885bcc34ececbc4a40557f83.mp4?t=1755887781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the world of Naltiune</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover unique and perilous landscapes that only the Naals have managed to inhabit for thousands of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master your long tail</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Scark'Tee's versatile tail, <i>hook</i> and sway to maneuver through the environment, attack enemies, hang onto other animals, and slide through interior tubes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help your friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter and assist other Naals on your journey, each with special abilities that will aid you in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face challenges</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome obstacles and unique enemies lurking in Naltiune, from wild creatures to deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an exciting narrative as you uncover the secrets of Naltiune and fight for the survival of the Naals.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2930640?t=1755887781","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/b80caa99486502eafeee8e16b082e481419216a9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755887781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/37698f91a533bb2d759fff4002966da6a8514828/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755887781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930640/37698f91a533bb2d759fff4002966da6a8514828/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755887781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","